X1031 h_trimtop h_trim h_trimbottom HORIZONTAL_TRIM
D1032 h_trim h_pd HOR_D
D1033 h_control h_pd HOR_D
Q1034 h_tank h_reactbase h_reactemit HOR_N
Q1035 h_col h_base h_drivebase HOR_N
Q1036 h_drivecol h_drivebase 0 HOR_DRIVER_N
X1037 h_tank h_supply h_tankright HORIZONTAL_TANK
X1038 h_drivetop h_drivecol h_outputbase 0 HORIZONTAL_DRIVER
* Bounded engineering families, NOT measured SC237E/SF1260/SF1280 curves.
.model HOR_D D(IS=1n N=1.5 RS=2 CJO=2p TT=5n)
.model HOR_N NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=100 VAF=80 CJE=20p CJC=8p TF=2n TR=10n)
.model HOR_DRIVER_N NPN(IS=1e-12 BF=60 VAF=80 CJE=150p CJC=80p TF=20n TR=100n)
.subckt HORIZONTAL_TRIM top wiper bottom
Ra top wiper {1000*(1-horizontal_trim_fraction)}
Rb wiper bottom {1000*horizontal_trim_fraction}
.ends HORIZONTAL_TRIM
* Tapped, phase-inverting tank. Inductance is PER HALF winding.
.subckt HORIZONTAL_TANK left middle right
Ra left a {horizontal_tank_r}
Rb right b {horizontal_tank_r}
La a middle {horizontal_tank_l}
Lb middle b {horizontal_tank_l}
Kcore La Lb {horizontal_coupling}
.ends HORIZONTAL_TANK
* Opposite polarity secondary for turn-off transformer drive.
.subckt HORIZONTAL_DRIVER top collector base ground
Rp top p {horizontal_driver_r}
Lp p collector {horizontal_driver_l}
Rs s base {horizontal_secondary_r}
Ls ground s {horizontal_driver_l/horizontal_driver_ratio^2}
Kcore Lp Ls {horizontal_coupling}
.ends HORIZONTAL_DRIVER
* Output families and normal-operation ancillary components; no SOA claim.
.model HOR_Z6 D(IS=1n N=1.5 RS=2 BV=6.2 IBV=1m)
.model HOR_RECT D(IS=10n N=1.5 RS=.2 CJO=20p TT=100n)
.model HOR_HV_RECT D(IS=1n N=2 RS=100 CJO=1p TT=100n)
.model HOR_OUTPUT_N NPN(IS=1e-10 BF=20 VAF=100 CJE=1n CJC=200p TF=100n TR=500n)
.subckt HORIZONTAL_CHOKE a b
Rloss a n {horizontal_choke_r}
Lcore n b {horizontal_choke_l}
.ends HORIZONTAL_CHOKE
.subckt HORIZONTAL_LINEARITY a b
Rloss a n {horizontal_linearity_r}
Lcore n b {horizontal_linearity_l}
.ends HORIZONTAL_LINEARITY
.subckt HORIZONTAL_COMPENSATION a b
Rloss a n {horizontal_compensation_r}
Lcore n b {horizontal_compensation_l}
.ends HORIZONTAL_COMPENSATION
.subckt HORIZONTAL_BRIGHTNESS low wiper high
Ra low wiper {1meg*horizontal_brightness_fraction}
Rb wiper high {1meg*(1-horizontal_brightness_fraction)}
.ends HORIZONTAL_BRIGHTNESS
.subckt HORIZONTAL_FOCUS high wiper low
Ra high wiper {1meg*(1-horizontal_focus_fraction)}
Rb wiper low {1meg*horizontal_focus_fraction}
.ends HORIZONTAL_FOCUS

